Week 04 Reflection

This week focused on routing concepts, 
including viewing routing tables and enabling packet forwarding. 
I built a network with multiple subnets and a router,
configured IP addresses, and examined routing tables using ip route show.
Additionally, I explored dynamic routing using OSPF and observed how routers automatically update paths when network changes occur. 
Using tools like traceroute,I was able to visualise packet paths. This helped me understand how routing ensures communication across different networks.
